      "site_admin": false,
      "name": null,
      "patch_url": null
    },
    "body": "Factor the secret and public nonce (de)serialization, partial signature (de)serialization, effective nonce computation and secret clearing out of the musig module into a new nonce_common module. These helpers are not specific to musig and can be reused by other modules implementing interactive signing protocols with two-point nonces.\r\n\r\nThis came out of my work on the [FullAgg/Dahlias PR](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/pull/1754) which requires exactly these same helpers but since this refactoring idea can be discussed independently of the new module I am putting it here separately, as [suggested by theStack](https://github.com/bitcoin-core/secp256k1/pull/1754#issuecomment-5681281301).",
